  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "YieldPoint/XSY is a multi-product crypto yield platform centered on Unity/UTY, a dollar-pegged synthetic dollar, and yUTY yield participation. The protocol provides synthetic-dollar yield exposure, with market-neutral or basis-trading strategy exposure as part of the underlying yield approach. The currently tracked surface should be described as the DefiLlama-tracked Avalanche deployment unless additional Base or other chain contracts are verified.",
